        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-waveform.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>If you've been online at all today, you'll know that what feels like the entire world is currently fawning over GTA 6. As <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-review\">the reviews dropped</a>, one thing quickly became very clear: this is a game absolutely packed with detail. Our own Chris noted that, thanks to this focus on specific detail and unbelievable nuance, Grand Theft Auto 6 is \"the most unbelievable video game world ever made\". And it's no accident: this is something Rockstar put a lot of dedicated effort into.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-detailed-fridge-noise\">Read more</a></p>",
