        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/clair-obscur-svedberg-yen.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Last night, it was revealed that <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/clair-obscur-expedition-33\">Clair Obscur: Expedition 33</a>'s lead narrative designer, Jennifer Svedberg-Yen, <a href=\"https://www.bafta.org/stories/breakthrough-us-2026/\">won a BAFTA Breakthrough US award</a> for her contribution to the hit 2025 game, which made history <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/clair-obscur-expedition-33-makes-game-awards-history-as-most-nominated-game-ever\">after winning 12 Game Award nominations last year</a>. In the aftermath of her win, Svedberg-Yen dropped a pretty big bombshell: she's no longer with the game's developer, Sandfall Interactive.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/clair-obscur-jennifer-svedberg-yen-bafta-fund-new-talent\">Read more</a></p>",
